{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734214",
      "title": "Validating User Input & Outputting Validation Errors",
      "sourceHash": "fe3d0e9b8330ccd33b85a8a96c5b2e710bf606c7cd927fdf5a920dd25b2e335b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 3.27,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.27,
          "end": 5.58,
          "en": "that we're showing validation errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.58,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "or any authentication related errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 11.94,
          "en": "we might be getting in general here above that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.94,
          "end": 15.03,
          "en": "And that is, of course, something we already did learn about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.03,
          "end": 17.16,
          "en": "in the Routing section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.16,
          "end": 20.43,
          "en": "For that, I'll go to the AuthForm.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.43,
          "end": 24.09,
          "en": "And in that file, I simply wanna get my action data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.09,
          "end": 26.61,
          "en": "So, the data returned by that action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.61,
          "end": 28.653,
          "en": "that was submitted by that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.67,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "We can get that data with help of the use action data hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 34.35,
          "en": "as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.35,
          "end": 38.31,
          "en": "So, here we can get that data with use action data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.31,
          "end": 43.11,
          "en": "and we only get that data if our action returns something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.11,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "if it returns something else, then a redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 48.66,
          "en": "So in this case, if it returns here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.66,
          "end": 52.89,
          "en": "if we got a status code of 422 or 401.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "In that case, it will return a response to us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 59.82,
          "en": "that includes some information about the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.82,
          "end": 62.823,
          "en": "that occurred when trying to authenticate the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.66,
          "end": 67.05,
          "en": "So here, to output that information to the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.05,
          "end": 69.81,
          "en": "I'll output it below this h1 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.81,
          "end": 72.15,
          "en": "and check if the data is generally set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.15,
          "end": 74.31,
          "en": "if it's available, if we do have data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.31,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "because we won't always have data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 79.293,
          "en": "Only if we did submit the form in the past.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.4,
          "end": 84.57,
          "en": "Then I check if an errors object is present on that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.57,
          "end": 87.96000000000001,
          "en": "It will be present if we have validation errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.96000000000001,
          "end": 89.13,
          "en": "And if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.13,
          "end": 91.44,
          "en": "then I'll output an unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.44,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "where I simply loop through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 95.493,
          "en": "all the error information I have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.39,
          "end": 98.49000000000001,
          "en": "Now, since errors will be an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.49000000000001,
          "end": 102.21000000000001,
          "en": "I will use a built-in function provided by JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.21000000000001,
          "end": 103.8,
          "en": "object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 108.57,
          "en": "to go through all the values in this errors object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 112.11,
          "en": "So, I'll pass data dot errors to values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.11,
          "end": 113.46000000000001,
          "en": "and that will give me an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 115.8,
          "en": "of all the error messages that I have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.8,
          "end": 119.69,
          "en": "So, I'll then map my error messages to list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.69,
          "end": 122.76,
          "en": "where the key is set equal to the error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.76,
          "end": 126.273,
          "en": "and where I output the error message like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.83,
          "end": 130.86,
          "en": "I will also add another check down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.86,
          "end": 134.13,
          "en": "and check if my data has a message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.13,
          "end": 137.76,
          "en": "if I have the message property on this data object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.76,
          "end": 140.67000000000002,
          "en": "and if the data object exists, as mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.67000000000002,
          "end": 144.123,
          "en": "And in that case, I'll also output data dot message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.677,
          "end": 148.59,
          "en": "So with that, I'm outputting any error data I'm getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.59,
          "end": 151.14,
          "en": "and we can already see that this was updated here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.14,
          "end": 153.51,
          "en": "and that this is the information I got",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 155.19,
          "en": "when I tried to create a user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.19,
          "end": 157.143,
          "en": "with an existing email address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.04,
          "end": 162.09,
          "en": "If I use a brand new different email address, then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.09,
          "end": 164.04,
          "en": "I, of course, won't get that error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 165.603,
          "en": "and instead I will succeed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 170.37,
          "en": "Now, the last thing which I want to add to this form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.37,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "is a little indicator that the form was submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 177.51,
          "en": "and that we're waiting for the response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.51,
          "end": 180.51,
          "en": "So, I wanna find out if we're currently submitting data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 180.51,
          "end": 183.21,
          "en": "And, we also learned about that in the Routing section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.21,
          "end": 184.89,
          "en": "We can use another hook for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 187.11,
          "en": "The use navigation hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.11,
          "end": 190.863,
          "en": "which gives us a navigation object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.03,
          "end": 195.12,
          "en": "and that navigation object has a state property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.12,
          "end": 198,
          "en": "which holds the current submission state, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198,
          "end": 201.063,
          "en": "or which lets us know whether we're currently submitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 205.47,
          "en": "So here, I'll then add a helper constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.47,
          "end": 208.07999999999998,
          "en": "called is submitting, where I check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.07999999999998,
          "end": 211.323,
          "en": "if navigation dot state is equal to submitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.19,
          "end": 214.98,
          "en": "In that case, I know that we're currently submitting data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 214.98,
          "end": 217.89,
          "en": "and I want to use that information down there at the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.89,
          "end": 220.05,
          "en": "for this save button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.05,
          "end": 224.31,
          "en": "Here, I wanna disable that button if we are submitting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.31,
          "end": 226.82999999999998,
          "en": "and I wanna output a different text based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.82999999999998,
          "end": 229.56,
          "en": "on whether we are submitting or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 230.61,
          "en": "If we are submitting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.61,
          "end": 233.16,
          "en": "I wanna output submitting, dot dot dot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.16,
          "end": 234.723,
          "en": "Otherwise, I'll output save.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.34,
          "end": 239.22,
          "en": "So, that's how I updated this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.22,
          "end": 240.15,
          "en": "Well, and with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 240.15,
          "end": 242.85,
          "en": "if I go back and create yet another user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.85,
          "end": 244.41,
          "en": "with a different email address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 244.41,
          "end": 246.42,
          "en": "I can click save, the button changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 246.42,
          "end": 247.773,
          "en": "and then I'm redirected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 248.61,
          "end": 251.07,
          "en": "So now, we got that sign-up process down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 251.07,
          "end": 253.02,
          "en": "and that's all working as it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 253.02,
          "end": 253.86,
          "en": "Let's stay on for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 253.86,
          "end": 256.443,
          "en": "Focus on logging the user in as a next step.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}